# LG TV hosts blocklist — a curated, balanced privacy layer.
# Derived from lg-tv-blocklist (https://github.com/furkan-bayrak/lg-tv-blocklist)
# lists/safe-hosts.txt plus selected OTA/telemetry/ads/ThinQ/voice entries from
# lists/strict-hosts.txt, pinned commit
# 68afe10de07bfdc8e8ecf91a7069a17419597271 (2026-09-28).
# Upstream lists: lg-tv-blocklist by furkan-bayrak, licensed CC BY 4.0
# (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: selection,
# extra OTA entries, and additions observed in a TV's DNS log noted below.
#
# Deliberately NOT blocked (store/app updates/account base terms stay working):
#   lgtvsdp.com, lgappstv.com (apex), lge.com (apex), lgeapi.com and all of its
#   subdomains, lgtvonline.lge.com, lgshopsvc.lgappstv.com, lgshopsvc.*
# iPad/phone interop discovery (discovery.meethue.com) is also left alone.
#
# Installed by the 10-hosts-blocklist init.d hook; see docs/guide.md, step 2.

